LAW_ENTITY regulates algorithmic recommendation services and requires services to implement guidelines and provisions including:

LAW_ENTITY establish management systems and technical measures for algorithm examination, user registration, information dissemination, security monitoring, incident response, data protection, and fraud prevention;

LAW_ENTITY conduct regular assessments of algorithms, models, data and application outcomes;

LAW_ENTITY strengthen information security management and identify unlawful/harmful information;

LAW_ENTITY implement tactics to avoid user harms and prohibit dissemination of misinformation;

LAW_ENTITY ban false account registration, trading, manipulation and anti-competitive practices;

LAW_ENTITY implement specific guidelines for services targeting minors, the elderly, workers and consumers;

LAW_ENTITY implement transparent and efficient complaint handling processes;

LAW_ENTITY establishes graded/categorized algorithm management system and filing procedures for relevant department authorities charged with oversight of algorithmic recommendation services;

LAW_ENTITY authorizes relevant departments to carry out security assessments and inspections and;

LAW_ENTITY specifies legal liabilities and penalties for violations.
